  "answer": "This has been reported before: the Command Palette dock minimizes along with other windows when you press Win+D, use the taskbar's Show desktop button, or do the trackpad show-desktop gesture. It comes back when you press Win+D again or restore a window. The archived ticket (PowerToys#48233) has no fix or workaround. The only update there is from the reporter, who said the behavior stopped on its own and they didn't know why. Add your details and your video to that ticket, including your PowerToys version and Windows build, so the team can see it still happens. Until a fix ships, press Win+D again or restore a window to bring the dock back."
